### 1. Register (copy token from response into variable below)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"owner@example.com","name":"Owner","password":"password123"}

### 2. Sign in
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"owner@example.com","password":"password123"}

### Replace these manually with IDs from previous responses:
@token = PASTE_JWT_HERE
@workspaceId = PASTE_WORKSPACE_UUID_HERE

### 3. Get workspaces
GET http://localhost:8080/api/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Create scheduled demo post
POST http://localhost:8080/api/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"content":"Experiment 3.3 Kafka demo post","platform":"INSTAGRAM","scheduledAt":"2030-01-01T10:00:00Z"}

### 5. Analytics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
